        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Показує тривогу на екрані блокування і в Dynamic Island до відбою."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "details.allClear.toggle" : {
      "comment" : "Details, Notifications section: the switch for our pushes when an air raid alert starts and ends in the driver's region. Owner's wording, 2026-11-10 («Уведомления о статусе тревоги»); no Apple key matches (\"Emergency Alerts\" is the government broadcast). UI-simplify AC-7.",
